SET 2 - COMPLETE PRACTICAL GUIDE
Docker with Python Flask | Kubernetes | ConfigMap | GitHub Basics

IMPORTANT: WHERE TO DO EACH PRACTICAL
=====================================

Use Killercoda in your browser: https://killercoda.com/

Practical 1 - Docker with Python Flask:
